content.text:
Now CSS landscape. Add media query. Note current `@media (max-width:900px) and (orientation: landscape)` sets positions. Add a new one after it with `@media (max-width: 900px) and (max-height: 520px)` or combine with landscape. Need override `top-actions`, `round-box`, `weapon-hud`. Also maybe hide `.intro` fineprint etc already.

Let's craft:

```
@media (max-width: 900px) and (max-height: 540px) and (orientation: landscape) {
  .hud-top { gap: 6px; }
  .hero-card {max-width: 52vw;}
  .enemy-stack { max-width: 40vw; }
  .round-box { top: max(70px, calc(env(safe-area-inset-top) + 66px)); bottom:auto; }
  .combo b { font-size: 30px; }
  .combo em { font-size:6px; }
  .top-actions { top: auto; bottom: calc(132px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); left:auto; right: max(14px,...); transform:none; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-end; gap:4px; }
  .weapon-hud { left: max(16px,...); right:auto; bottom: calc(146px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); transform: rotate(-2deg); text-align:left; justify-items:start; }
  .weapon-hud strong {font-size:17px;}
  .controls {bottom: max(10px...)}
  .joystick { width:96px; height:96px; }
  ...
  .round-btn.attack { width:92px;height:92px;}
  .round-btn.swap{width:62px;height:62px;}
}
```

But top-actions right at bottom 132: attack cluster at right bottom 10 + 92 height = 102; chips at y = 390-132-? = ~236, above. fine. However the right edge might cover fat man? fat at screen x~600, chips at 760. Fine.

Weapon HUD left bottom 146: joystick top 390-10-96=284; weapon at y~230. Hero head at y~120. So weapon sits left of hero torso? Hero center x~380, weapon x 20-110. okay.

Combo top 70: might overlap the top of central scene/neon, but hero head at y~120. combo 70-100, fine.

Also move `.round-label` hidden already.

Let's add.

